  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action and Support to Avert, Minimize and Address Displacement in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Kenya will generate enhanced knowledge on loss, damage and displacement in Kenya, strengthen preparedness of the government and local communities for disaster displacement, and support integration of displacement into relevant policies in Kenya. The proposed action is in line with the priorities and framework of the PDD&#x2019;s global Project to Avert, Minimize and Address Disaster Displacement (PAMAD).</narrative>
  </description>
